/// \file
/// Semantic coverage metadata for the encodings admitted by X87Context.h.
/// NEVERD_X87_FORM(Id, Escape, FirstModRM, LastModRM, Memory, Mnemonic,
///                 Operands, TypedLift, ValueClass, PortableOperation)
/// Memory ModRM values are opcode groups; address bits remain with the lifter.
/// Operand16 selects the short environment form. Register ranges enumerate all
/// eight ST(i) operands. This table records implementation, not test execution.
/// ExactValue describes the value projection only, subject to CFG/tag/control
/// preconditions; it does not assert complete architectural-state fidelity.
//===----------------------------------------------------------------------===//

